source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A `{{` a backslash precedes opens no Monospace Span, so Jira breaks and shows the braces; jiro reads a hard break and plain text.
-- input.jira --
a\\{{b}}
-- rendered.html --
<p>a<br class="atl-forced-newline" />{{b}}</p>
-- want.md --
a\
{{b}}
-- warnings.json --
[]
